---
import Section from "./Section.astro";
---

<Section id="about" index={3} title="About">
    <div class="space-y-5 text-[15px] sm:text-base text-ink leading-relaxed">
        <p>
            Lon Hutt is a Principal Engineer with 20 years of experience
            building developer tools and platforms, most recently at Salesforce,
            with prior work at MarkLogic. His focus is the layer underneath the
            code — build systems, dev environments, internal tooling — the
            infrastructure that determines whether engineers spend their day
            building or fighting their setup. He also works more broadly as a
            senior engineering consultant on problems that need judgment and
            experience over a quick fix.
        </p>
        <p>
            Based in the Denver, Colorado area working with engineering teams
            wherever they are.
        </p>
    </div>
</Section>
